OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,
OL,6,Fblustery and possibly thundery,
OL,7,Fshowers in the far south overnight.
OL,8,FIncreasingly murky in other central
OL,9,Fand southern areas with patchy fog and
OL,10,Fshowery rain. Turning widely frosty
OL,11,Ffurther north under clearing skies but
OL,12,Fwintry showers in the far northeast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FRather cloudy in southern
OL,15,Fareas with any showery rain gradually
OL,16,Fdying out and brightening up in
OL,17,Fplaces. Colder but much sunnier
OL,18,Ffurther north with showers in the
OL,19,Fnortheast, locally wintry.
